# Pinned adroit rev consumed by `just init-adroit`.
# 7ff4042: published adroit `main` — the KB-only adroit (its ADR-0020: path
#   mode is retired; `--dir`/`ADROIT_DIR` must name a KB space carrying a
#   wiki.toml, and `adroit seed --from <legacy-dir> --dir <space>` bootstraps
#   a fresh space from a legacy corpus). Also carries the guarded MCP write
#   slice behind --allow-write (its ADR-0021 — conduit never uses it) and
#   lowercase status serialization in -o json (the KB `decision` schema's
#   status enum). Supersedes cc43754, the last path-mode pin.
#   Reachable on the adroit remote (main line), so a cold clone resolves it
#   with NO sibling. init-adroit still falls back to a sibling ../adroit when
#   the remote is unreachable (its HEAD, loudly, if it lacks this exact pin).
